 Redemption arc Audra feels  responsible for the Skeksis ah's  takeover of thraw she was the one who  gave the Skeksis the crystal of truth in  exchange for the orrery this mechanical  model of the solar system she spent  years searching the cosmos and learning  from the technology given to her by the  Skeksis that it was only when thrall was  facing great harm that she was awoken  from her dreamlike state agra offers her  life in exchange to free the gelfling x'  but if there's anything we know about  the Skeksis it's that they almost always  go back on their word Brants ella didn't  make up even though Selatan should  probably be tried for war crimes we then  get to the major battle this entire  season has building up - which starts  with the general taking on rien and his  duel clave the general is ultimately  stabbed by Rhian but here's the  interesting thing what appears to be the  generals essence or at least part of it  is sucked into the crystal of the duel  clave now the general doesn't die here  it only happens a bit later when the  Chamberlain does the  so it's uncertain whether this energy  transference was fully complete  regardless this is some definite season  to set up and the power of the crystal  char to transfer energy will undoubtedly  come into play next season perhaps even  helping transfer the darkness from DEET  another big question mark is if the  general is actually dead he's alive in  the 1982 movie which is set after the  events of age of resistance so it's  entirely possible that this energy  transference was successful and some  part of the general lives within that  crystal how he'll come back to life is  anyone's guess but with Agua coming back  from the dead anything is possible  also did Bree and just forget about his  girlfriend Mira awkward we get a better  look at the crystal shard after Brea  picks it up from the shattered dual  clave this is the same crystal shard Jen  will use in the movie to heal the  crystal of truth and the same one which  will come into the possession of agra  after the gelfling genocide in the  battle the hunter grabs Rhian and  destroys the dual blade but before he  can finish the job on rien archer the  hunter's mystic opposite kills himself  thus killing the hunter again if you  want to know more about how this process  works check out my other Dark Crystal  video with the hunter killed augers  essence is reborn and the seven clans of  the gelfling show up in the nick of time  to take on the Skeksis not only that but  the era thumb have also joined their  side after they found out that they were  double-crossed by the Skeksis who gave  them back the cave of grot only to find  that it was infested with darkness with  no alternative the emperor uses his  staff which contains the power of the  darkening which DEET is able to hold off  and ultimately blow awkwafina's head off  this causes the Skeksis to run away in  fear with the battle one a few questions  remain as to what will happen next  season chiefly among them what the heck  has happened to deat we see her walk off  into the distance away from rien likely  for his own good she's infected as is  evidenced by the dying plants around her  and likely doesn't want anyone around  her my guess is that the only thing  preventing her from being overtaken by  the darkness was the power given to her  by the sanctuary tree we also don't know  if Saladin will remain the al mandra  after what she put her people through  HUP seems to have found the yellow  trinket which is able to conjure lore so  we'll probably see more of that in  season two and like  descendants to a full-on paladin the  final scene however looks pretty grim  for the Skeksis they're petrified that  their days are numbered  until the scientists reveals his newest  creation the Garthim the Garthim army  was used in the Dark Crystal movie to  undertake the annihilation of the  gelfling x' so season 2 will likely see  them building this army up and utilizing  it there's also the question of the  crystal shard that Brea picks up and how  it eventually gets into the hands of  Agra along with several other fake  crystals the Skeksis will eventually  find out about this shard and hide fake  ones to throw the golfing's off we also  haven't visited the ruins which Jen and  Kira find in the movie the ones that  reveal to them the prophecy that will  lead to the downfall of the Skeksis plan  on finding more about this next season  but I want to hear your thoughts about  this truly awesome season in the  comments below if you haven't already  please do check out my other Dark  Crystal video make sure to LIKE and  subscribe with the Belon because I have  more breakdown videos on the horizon you  can also feel free to follow me on  twitter at things story whitey and until  next time remember daddy loves you very  much
 

